---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Markup from "../components/Markup.astro";
import Copy from "../components/Copy.astro";
import Subscribe from "../components/Subscribe.astro";
import { averages2, round2, bestCount } from "../lib/evidence";

const questions = [
  ["Expert moves", "What would a top professional in this field do that you didn't ask for?", "One or two moves, not a list of tips."],
  ["Raw material", "What would they start from?", "The data, files and originals, not a summary of them. And one belief that material could disprove."],
  ["Instruments", "Which methods and tools would they use?", "A test, a measurement, a real canon, plus the skills and agents you already have."],
  ["Outside check", "What would show the result is right, other than you or the model?", "With a pass mark the best in the field would set."],
];
---
<Base>
  <section class="band-red hero">
    <svg class="giant" viewBox="0 0 760 560" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M380 0L760 560H560L380 270L200 560H0Z" /></svg>
    <div class="wrap hero-in">
      <h1>Ask for the version <ins class="ins"><span class="caret" aria-hidden="true"></span>an&nbsp;expert</ins> would ask&nbsp;for.</h1>
      <p class="lede">A free skill for coding agents. Type <code>/deeper</code> before a task and it asks for the method, sources and checks a top professional would use. Same scope. You approve before it runs.</p>
      <div class="act">
        <Copy text="npx skills add EazyAccessEA/deeper" label="Copy the install command" />
        <p class="chat">No terminal? <a href="/start/#chat">Use it in ChatGPT, Claude.ai or Gemini</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band demo" id="markup" aria-labelledby="markup-h">
    <div class="wrap"><Markup /></div>
  </section>

  <section class="band band-black questions" aria-labelledby="q-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="q-head">
        <h2 id="q-h">Four questions before any rewrite.</h2>
      </div>
      <ol>
        {questions.map(([name, q, more], i) => (
          <li>
            <span class="q-name">{i + 1}&ensp;{name}</span>
            <div><h3>{q}</h3><p class="muted">{more}</p></div>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
      <p class="after muted">Then one prompt you can copy, asking for the same deliverables you did, and a question: run it? Anything else an expert would add goes on one line, "Worth knowing, not in this task", for you to choose. If a task is too small for depth to matter, it says so in one line and stops.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band evidence" aria-labelledby="ev-h">
    <div class="wrap ev-in">
      <div class="ev-copy">
        <h2 id="ev-h">Best on {bestCount("v1.1b")} of {round2.length}<br /> blind tasks.</h2>
        <p>Five real tasks, each rewritten without the skill and by two versions of deeper, then scored in one pass by a judge on a different model that didn't know which was which. It's one run on five tasks, judged by a model, so treat it as a reason to try deeper rather than proof. Version 1.1 stops adding work you didn't ask for and keeps every check.</p>
        <a href="/research/">Every prompt, score and reason</a>
      </div>
      <table>
        <caption class="sr">Average blind-test scores out of 5</caption>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Average, out of 5</th><th scope="col">No skill</th><th scope="col"><span class="long">deeper </span>1.0</th><th scope="col" class="v11">deeper 1.1</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {averages2.map((a) => (
            <tr><th scope="row">{a.label}{a.label.startsWith("Extra") && <span class="muted"> (lower is better)</span>}</th><td>{a.plain}</td><td>{a["v1.0"]}</td><td class="v11">{a["v1.1b"]}</td></tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band band-red close" id="install" aria-labelledby="in-h">
    <div class="wrap close-in">
      <div class="install">
        <h2 id="in-h">Installs where you already work.</h2>
        <p>Claude Code, Codex, Cursor and about seventy other agents, through the <a href="https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills">skills CLI</a>. Running it is tested in Claude Code, Cursor and Codex. There's also a Claude Code plugin, a copy-by-hand route, and a way to paste it into ChatGPT or any chat app.</p>
        <a class="more" href="/docs/#install">Install, update or remove</a>
      </div>
      <div class="updates" id="updates">
        <h3>Hear when it changes.</h3>
        <p>Each version is tested blind before it ships. Get the new skill and the scores when they land.</p>
        <Subscribe />
        <p class="team">Rolling deeper out to a team? <a href="mailto:hello@deeper.tools?subject=deeper%20for%20a%20team">Tell us what you need</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  /* Hero: one red field with the header, the poster headline and one giant caret. */
  .hero { position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding-block: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem) clamp(5rem, 9vw, 7.5rem); }
  .giant { position: absolute; right: clamp(-3rem, -2vw, -1rem); bottom: -2.5rem; width: clamp(12rem, 46vw, 44rem); fill: var(--white); }
  .hero-in { position: relative; }
  h1 { font-size: var(--d1); line-height: 0.92; max-width: 7.6em; }
  /* nowrap keeps the caret on the same line as the words it inserts. */
  h1 .ins { white-space: nowrap; text-decoration-thickness: 0.06em; text-underline-offset: 0.1em; }
  h1 .caret { width: 0.42em; height: 0.31em; vertical-align: 0; }
  .lede { margin-top: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem); max-width: 30em; font-size: var(--t-lg); line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 500; }
  .lede code { font-size: 0.9em; }
  .act { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 1.75rem; }
  .chat { font-weight: 500; }
  .chat a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 2.75rem; }
  /* The page's one authored moment: the inserted words come into focus. Blur only, so the headline paints at once (LCP). */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    h1 .ins { animation: focus 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.1s both; }
    @keyframes focus { from { filter: blur(6px); } }
  }

  .questions h2, .evidence h2, .close h2 { font-size: var(--d2); }
  .q-head { padding-bottom: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 3rem); }
  .questions h2 { max-width: 9em; }
  .questions ol { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  .questions li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 13rem minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 0.5rem 2.5rem; padding: 2rem 0 2.25rem; border-top: 1.5px solid var(--white); }
  .q-name { font-weight: 600; color: var(--white); padding-top: 0.6rem; }
  .questions h3 { font-size: var(--d3); line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-weight: 700; color: var(--white); }
  .questions li p { margin-top: 0.6rem; }
  .after { margin-top: 1.5rem; max-width: 34em; }

  .ev-in { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 7fr); gap: 3rem 5rem; align-items: start; }
  .ev-copy p { margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem; max-width: 30em; }
  .ev-copy a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 2.75rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .evidence thead th { border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink); font-size: var(--t-sm); white-space: nowrap; }
  .evidence thead th:not(:first-child), .evidence td { text-align: right; width: 7rem; padding-right: 0; }
  .evidence thead th.v11 { color: var(--red-text); }
  .evidence tbody th { font-weight: 400; padding: 1.1rem 1rem 1.1rem 0; vertical-align: baseline; }
  .evidence td { font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: 75%; line-height: 1; color: var(--grey); vertical-align: baseline; padding: 0.9rem 0; }
  .evidence td.v11 { color: var(--red-text); font-weight: 800; }
  .evidence tbody tr { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }

  .close-in { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 6fr) minmax(0, 5fr); gap: 3rem 5rem; }
  .install p { margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem; max-width: 32em; font-size: var(--t-lg); line-height: 1.5; }
  .install a { color: var(--white); }
  .more { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 2.75rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .updates { padding-top: 0.75rem; }
  .updates h3 { font-size: var(--d3); color: var(--white); letter-spacing: -0.035em; }
  .updates > p { margin: 0.75rem 0 1.25rem; }
  .team { margin-top: 1.5rem; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .ev-in, .close-in { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .questions li { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); padding: 1.4rem 0 1.6rem; }
    .q-name { padding-top: 0; font-size: var(--t-sm); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    h1 { max-width: none; }
    .lede { font-size: var(--t-base); }
    .act { display: block; }
    .chat { margin-top: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.9375rem; }
    .giant { width: 12.5rem; right: -1.25rem; bottom: -0.75rem; }
    .hero { padding-bottom: 9rem; }
    .evidence .long { display: none; }
    .evidence thead th:not(:first-child), .evidence td { width: 3.75rem; }
    .evidence thead th.v11 { width: 5rem; }
    .evidence td { font-size: 1.6rem; }
    .evidence tbody th { font-size: 0.9375rem; }
  }
</style>
